{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_002chi0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_002chi0084_1000_p", "source_sha256": "3f3b6570419fa031626abfb6b7e7ca4bf2c769c4db3c49ba2a51b7afd82802f2", "ja": "（千早の新しい衣装ができた。ブログで発表して\nもらったところ、反響はかなりのものだ！）", "zh": "（千早的新服装完成了。请她在部落格发表以后，\n获得了不小的回响！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_002chi0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_002chi0084_1001_002chi", "source_sha256": "27cbbcba89df2cd62fa0106748d4b5253e679c76c6e60715f8e419735f42b7e4", "ja": "もっと、引き出せるはず……。\n歌、ダンス……最高のタイミングで、この角度……。", "zh": "应该可以做得更好……\n唱歌、舞蹈……在最佳时机，摆出这个角度……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_002chi0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_002chi0084_1002_p", "source_sha256": "9da005dc092b7347d6e3d557d3fb6ee31e04f725cf5a288ee279e2828bd29869", "ja": "千早？　衣装の確認……にしては、\nずいぶん気合いが入ってるんだな？", "zh": "千早？看你好像在确认服装……\n但你怎这么有干劲呀？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_002chi0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_002chi0084_1003_002chi", "source_sha256": "a0ed13a13ea5a5fc43a1297e587b03036862bc8472700c025ceb6a34855a9d9e", "ja": "あ、{$P$}……はい。ブログに\nコメントをくれたみなさんの期待に、応えたくて。", "zh": "啊，{$P$}……是的，\n因为我不想辜负在部落格留言的粉丝们。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_002chi0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_002chi0084_1004_002chi", "source_sha256": "efc591b63fb9868b6fd17bd20d08879d6e841c6b5cff8ea17732a02b27e8f230", "ja": "それに、この衣装……。着ているだけで、\nいくつものフレーズが浮かんでくるんです。", "zh": "而且这套服装……光是穿上她，\n脑中就浮现了好几个乐句。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_002chi0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_002chi0084_1005_002chi", "source_sha256": "753bfdf44e44188d2ba62ff72c2e1be073fa509cfc90e2938f7a1cf804516617", "ja": "もしかしたら、衣装そのものが、ステージを待ち望んで\nいるのかもしれませんね。……ふふっ。", "zh": "说不定，这套服装自己也很期待登台演出呢。\n……呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_002chi0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_002chi0084_1006_p", "source_sha256": "2ab24d19a65f18effd7fee7e1b44e6ab0214a18a79608c54febe6d9f55aad7c3", "ja": "はは、そうかもな。\nなんなら、これからリハーサルでもするか？", "zh": "哈哈，可能真的是这样呢。\n等等要不要直接去排练？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_002chi0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_002chi0084_1007_002chi", "source_sha256": "a4fd6e0442420a032f496eb42cc3052e604bb9c4646a8b95de14c933499ea430", "ja": "いいんですか？　ぜひ、お願いします。\nきっとこの子も喜ぶと思います！", "zh": "可以吗？那就麻烦你了。\n我想这孩子也会很高兴的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_002chi0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_002chi0084_1008", "source_sha256": "d5837f0e12346a81efe95c6f8f33ac4852eeb7851239db98c087e4ebe2f2e465", "ja": "この子？", "zh": "这孩子？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_002chi0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_002chi0084_2000_p", "source_sha256": "d5837f0e12346a81efe95c6f8f33ac4852eeb7851239db98c087e4ebe2f2e465", "ja": "この子？", "zh": "这孩子？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_002chi0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_002chi0084_2001_002chi", "source_sha256": "f9f95a5e773f0bcae372aab04968812d7a5da1bc82ec5b4b989635d5d850e0fd", "ja": "はっ！　……す、すみません、つい！\nあの、愛着がわいてしまって……。", "zh": "啊！不、不好意思……一不小心就！\n因为我对她已经有了情感……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_002chi0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_002chi0084_2002_002chi", "source_sha256": "041b5ad6cc807e167856ce8d02be92056c1bd47ba4a3979152a7c4b7f5da0db2", "ja": "聞かなかったことにしてください！\n衣装を擬人化なんて……恥ずかしい……！", "zh": "请你当我什么都没说！\n我居然把服装拟人化……真是难为情……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_002chi0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_002chi0084_2003_p", "source_sha256": "e1633a74d372af3c90b4c717e5a54bd3cac010c60c59e1609035a1e4c0675296", "ja": "いや、別にそんなに慌てなくても……。\nそんなに珍しいことじゃないと思うぞ？", "zh": "没事，你用不着这么慌张……\n我觉得这不是什么稀奇的事喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_002chi0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_002chi0084_2004_002chi", "source_sha256": "df744f7a93f4902085b759f09b4ca764a9d85674ce856e9773b641633b669a89", "ja": "えっ。……そ、そうなんですか？", "zh": "咦……是、是这样子吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_002chi0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_002chi0084_2005_p", "source_sha256": "a9eea88d09cf85362f7062b0cf332378e6bad738ad61ca61cae67f0cced4486a", "ja": "ああ、そんな風に呼ぶ人はわりといるみたいだし。\nそれに、たぶんだけど……。", "zh": "是呀，会这样称呼的人好像也不少。\n而且，虽然只是我的臆测……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_002chi0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_002chi0084_2006_p", "source_sha256": "f1a3fe75fb1414e1047ed89d0e52d8f5f12212a8a8ca8541704c124e84d397a8", "ja": "衣装を大事にしない千早より、衣装を大事にする\n千早の方が、いい歌が歌えるんじゃないかな。", "zh": "比起不爱护服装的千早，我想还是爱护服装\n会让千早唱起歌来动听得多呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_002chi0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_002chi0084_2007_002chi", "source_sha256": "c8a1e029382e99c10c3680f75be49838d2d47267cf6253769aa6478f2f1b858d", "ja": "あ……。", "zh": "啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_002chi0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_002chi0084_2008_002chi", "source_sha256": "85243394c5508f832903c70d9bcd5fb48b1bdd66ce077456f6eaf91014b65341", "ja": "そう、かもしれませんね……。\nいえ、そうだと思います。", "zh": "或许真的是这样呢……\n不，我觉得就是这样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_002chi0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_002chi0084_2009_p", "source_sha256": "ea67b76fa61edeb8259ec73fd87593a58ffdca9ecd8797c1fe22bd3085145cff", "ja": "うん。だから、これからも恥ずかしがらずに、\nどんどんその子を大事にしてくれていいぞ！", "zh": "嗯，所以你今后也别觉得难为情，\n尽管爱护那孩子没关系的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_002chi0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_002chi0084_2010_002chi", "source_sha256": "6d9fc55a818a4948c996766a402e6719ba25e428ec06b0ce71eab797c86d9c7a", "ja": "わ、わかりました。\nその……恥ずかしくならない範囲で、適度に。", "zh": "我、我明白了，那个……\n我会在不感到难为情的范围内适度表现的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_002chi0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_002chi0084_2011_002chi", "source_sha256": "8245e8cb6937e089a82f4e2b796ff1d876261e356835743362e6049d9d0cfb16", "ja": "歌の技術とは関係がなくても、間違いなく歌を構成する\n大切な要素。衣装は、そういうものだと思います。", "zh": "虽然跟歌唱的技术无关，但毫无疑问是构成\n一首歌的重要元素。我觉得服装就是这样的东西。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_002chi0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_002chi0084_2012_002chi", "source_sha256": "2bc2a84f00d5c66e709e0553a2964e3144df19fcff54fb79c00ddde877c92988", "ja": "ステージの調和のためにも、歌をより魅力的に\n伝えるためにも……やはり、大切にするべきかと。", "zh": "这也是为了做好表演时的画面平衡，\n让歌声显得更有魅力……爱护服装是应该的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_002chi0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_002chi0084_2013_002chi", "source_sha256": "9f79fc9723faeeb00b32f1f5b471e6100ae4b0ab44a4daa05a49d310c72e3580", "ja": "……ぷっ。ふふっ！", "zh": "……噗、呵呵！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_002chi0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_002chi0084_2014_p", "source_sha256": "5b8df6b0e501eba5acd139b111029761d9b2ad820ee38ccc3b2662e8f5730c6d", "ja": "ん？　急にどうしたんだ？", "zh": "嗯？你怎么突然笑了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_002chi0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_002chi0084_2015_002chi", "source_sha256": "76dff28f390c9bad0fdbe4cb4c64994465ab670c0ca55076f6d317d755fcf739", "ja": "あ、すみません。\nつい、自分でおかしくなってしまって。", "zh": "啊，不好意思。\n我不禁觉得自己有点好笑。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_002chi0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_002chi0084_2016_002chi", "source_sha256": "f85a28a02ffa4da792c30be2a08a636d5e625da629358c7b326cd5559e070023", "ja": "衣装なんて、歌には何の関係もない……。\n以前はそう思っていましたから。", "zh": "服装根本就和唱歌一点关系都没有……\n以前的我是这么想的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_002chi0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_002chi0084_2017_p", "source_sha256": "1e95f7384202dc5c008bdb7d69227e87e2d7e72ff2292ebfccb21c41e78ed6b3", "ja": "はは、そうだっけ？　でも今は違うんだよな？\nなら、何よりだよ。", "zh": "哈哈，真的吗？但你现在改观了不是吗？\n这样就好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_002chi0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_002chi0084_2018_002chi", "source_sha256": "d2bce8274722952d318f2882d97e167e932a3280bb14cfdc6b5031138fa526e8", "ja": "はい、おかげさまで。\n……ふふっ！", "zh": "嗯，托你的福。\n……呵呵！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_002chi0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_002chi0084_2019_002chi", "source_sha256": "286e327a2713901695fe2a88f0d3b927aeb31034baa464ac9ed957690cbb96e4", "ja": "では、早速ですがリハーサル、お願いできますか？\nしっかり、この子を着……。", "zh": "那不好意思，可以麻烦你马上开始陪我排练吗？\n这也是为了让自己配得上这孩子……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_002chi0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_002chi0084_2020_002chi", "source_sha256": "a11d4be3dc202889cbd9b99f16129a0efe678b5ed4f1107e08aa2be436510a76", "ja": "この衣装を、着こなせるように。\nあの、よろしくお願いしますっ！", "zh": "为了让自己配得上这套服装。\n那个，就麻烦你了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
